    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "views": {
        "type": "array",
        "description": "List of views. 'current' captures the person's screen exactly as framed, without moving the camera or re-zooming -- use it whenever they refer to what they can see. Named orientations: top, bottom, front, back, left, right, iso, iso_top_left, iso_bottom_right. Several may be requested at once. Default ['iso'].",
